WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:02,040
Brother Yuan, how are you?

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:04,520
Is this strength comfortable? Yes, yes.

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,720
This strength is just right, Brother Yuan

4
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:10,040
Look at my promotion to the 4S level, please pray.

5
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,520
I have to criticize you for this.

6
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:14,200
Young ghosts can't be so good. Is Gao Wuyuan precipitated enough?

7
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,200
I’m so anxious to advance to 4S level

8
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,800
Can you take on that responsibility, Brother Yuan?

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,640
I will give you all my wealth

10
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,440
As long as you can help me become a 4S level

11
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,480
Oops, little prayer husband

12
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,040
Your brother Yuan is a helpful person.

13
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:29,780
This matter is due to Brother Yuan

14
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:30,740
Help

15
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,980
Escaped all the way here

16
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,780
This is the helper you are looking for
